## AniTails System Tor Configuration (Tor >= 0.4.9.15 / 0.4.9.16)
## Implements Tor Proposal 171 Stream Isolation, Automap .onion resolution,
## Pluggable Transports via lyrebird, and strict zero-disk-write operation.

User tor
DataDirectory /var/lib/tor
AvoidDiskWrites 1

## Start with network disabled until user confirms settings / bridges / clock
DisableNetwork 1

## --- Proposal 171 Stream-Isolated SOCKSPorts ---
## 1. Default SocksPort for CLI/desktop apps (Thunderbird, Git, SSH, curl):
SocksPort 127.0.0.1:9050 IsolateDestAddr IsolateDestPort SessionGroup=1

## 2. Dedicated SocksPort for AniTails system utilities (time check / advisory check):
SocksPort 127.0.0.1:9062 IsolateDestAddr IsolateDestPort SessionGroup=2

## 3. Dedicated SocksPort for high-sensitivity tools (Electrum / OnionShare):
SocksPort 127.0.0.1:9065 IsolateDestAddr IsolateDestPort SessionGroup=4

## 4. Dedicated SocksPort on veth-tbb for Tor Browser (isolated netns 'tbb'):
##    Tor Browser sets first-party URL domain in SOCKS5 username/password.
SocksPort 10.200.1.1:9050 IsolateSOCKSAuth KeepAliveIsolateSOCKSAuth SessionGroup=3

## --- Raw ControlPort (root-only; applications MUST connect via anitails-onion-grater on 9051) ---
ControlPort 127.0.0.1:9052
CookieAuthentication 1
CookieAuthFile /run/tor/control.authcookie
CookieAuthFileGroupReadable 0

## --- Torified DNS & .onion Automapping ---
DNSPort 127.0.0.1:5353
VirtualAddrNetworkIPv4 127.192.0.0/10
AutomapHostsOnResolve 1
AutomapHostsSuffixes .onion

## --- Transparent Proxy for Automapped .onion Addresses ONLY ---
TransPort 127.0.0.1:9040 IsolateDestAddr IsolateDestPort SessionGroup=5

## --- Pluggable Transports (extracted from PGP-verified Tor Expert Bundle 16.0) ---
ClientTransportPlugin meek_lite,obfs2,obfs3,obfs4,scramblesuit,webtunnel exec /usr/bin/lyrebird

## --- Hardening & Logging ---
SafeLogging 1
WarnPlaintextPorts 23,109
Log notice syslog
